                                "sense_id": "5183baea-3fa0-36fd-81ec-9b6477076be2",
                                "text": "Deputy United States Marshal H. B. Holman returned here on the Kansas City Southern Railroad, to which place he was called by a message from the manager of a large fruit-growing company, asking protection from whitecappers."
                            },
