                                "sense_id": "5183baea-3fa0-36fd-81ec-9b6477076be2",
                                "text": "To the gratification of many local whites, an all-white jury acquitted Brown of the charge of murder and ruled that the shooting of the whitecapper had been a justifiable homicide."
